{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54696","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 三十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 三十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太阳畔，气若璧形圆。\n其影团圆（京本作「团」）如晕色，羣（京本作「郡」）邦臣下反（京本作「反主」）谋专，夺我境边田。\n（主小臣谋反分国。\n京本注：「主小臣谋叛分国侵夺之事。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54696.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54696","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}